  "text": "Low Effort Pthentraken\n\n​\nDisclaimer\n⬥ IF YOU CANNOT GET A METHOD TO WORK DO NOT MESSAGE THE CREATOR(S)\n‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• It is more than likely user error or cutting corners, use #pvm-help if you cannot get it to work\n​\nPositioning\n\n​\n⬥  +  South-East diagonally when entering the arena\n‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• If Orikalka  has already spawned, avoid getting aggro'd by hugging the West wall before  +  East\n⬥ Stand just West or East of the boss spawn (it doesn't matter which)\n​\nRanged Low Effort Method  50+ KPH\nOverview\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n⬥ The following ARE REQUIRED for this method to work:\n    • **Cutting corners will result in failure, **\n    • A more extensive list can be found in #unknown-channel\n\nRequirements\n⬥ Igneous Kal-Xil \n⬥ Scripture of Ful  or Scripture of Wen \n⬥ Any nexus  \n    • Runes for Darkness \n⬥ Blood Reaver familiar  (does not require scrolls)\n⬥ Necklace of Salamancy \n⬥ Deathspore  or Wen \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n​\nPresets and Relics\n⬥ Ranged preset \n​\n\nAction Bar\n\n​\nThe fight\n⬥ Simply press  when the blue bar above your head is empty\n​\nExample Kills\n⬥ Example kills\n\n\n​\n      \n    ",
  "normalizedText": "Low Effort Pthentraken ​ Disclaimer ⬥ IF YOU CANNOT GET A METHOD TO WORK DO NOT MESSAGE THE CREATOR(S) ‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• It is more than likely user error or cutting corners, use #pvm-help if you cannot get it to work ​ Positioning ​ ⬥ + South-East diagonally when entering the arena ‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• If Orikalka has already spawned, avoid getting aggro'd by hugging the West wall before + East ⬥ Stand just West or East of the boss spawn (it doesn't matter which) ​ Ranged Low Effort Method 50+ KPH Overview ⬥ The following ARE REQUIRED for this method to work: • **Cutting corners will result in failure, ** • A more extensive list can be found in #unknown-channel Requirements ⬥ Igneous Kal-Xil ⬥ Scripture of Ful or Scripture of Wen ⬥ Any nexus • Runes for Darkness ⬥ Blood Reaver familiar (does not require scrolls) ⬥ Necklace of Salamancy ⬥ Deathspore or Wen ​ Presets and Relics ⬥ Ranged preset ​ Action Bar ​ The fight ⬥ Simply press when the blue bar above your head is empty ​ Example Kills ⬥ Example kills ​",
